# Root pointer — Syntra ERP has no single root .env.
# Each service owns its own env file. Copy the one(s) you run:
#
#   apps/backend/.env.example  → Core API (port 3001): DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, …
#   apps/erp/.env.example      → ERP API (port 3002): DATABASE_URL, CORE_API_URL
#   apps/frontend/.env.example → Frontend (port 3000): CORE_API_URL, ERP_API_URL, AI_API_URL
#   apps/ai/.env.example       → AI API (port 3003): LLM_API_KEY, CORE_API_URL, ERP_API_URL
#
# Quick start: docker compose up -d, then pnpm --filter core db:migrate, then pnpm dev.
# See README.md “Quick Start” and each apps/*/.env.example for required values.
